  m_Name: Status_Effect_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e842e6af1227296438f192bafb99765c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 722079744
    m_Localized: Defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 793382912
    m_Localized: While [Defense], negates the opponent's attack. Removes [Defense]
      after successfully blocking an attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351049
  - m_Id: 72098723270656
    m_Localized: Breakthrough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72098777796608
    m_Localized: While [Breakthrough], ignores the opponent's [Defense] status effect.
      Removes [Breakthrough] after a successful attack that bypasses the target's
      [Defense].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351050
  - m_Id: 72943439319040
    m_Localized: Degeneration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72943439319041
    m_Localized: When a piece under [Degeneration] is removed by an attack or absorption,
      creates 1 allied Jellu [Pawn] on an adjacent empty tile. The created piece
      inherits the Traits of the removed piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351051
  - m_Id: 16559834879627264
    m_Localized: Attack Disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16559834950930432
    m_Localized: While [Attack Disabled], cannot make a move that would capture an
      enemy piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351052
  - m_Id: 16700000000000001
    m_Localized: Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16700000000000002
    m_Localized: When an adjacent allied piece is attacked, swaps places with it
      and takes the attack instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16720000000000001
    m_Localized: Evasion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16720000000000002
    m_Localized: When attacked, has a 50% chance to move to an adjacent empty tile
      and evade the attack. The attacking piece moves to the vacated tile. Removes
      [Evasion] after successfully evading an attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351053
  - m_Id: 17388937073528832
    m_Localized: Move Disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17388937149026304
    m_Localized: While [Move Disabled], can only move to capture an enemy piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351054
  - m_Id: 17402470121213952
    m_Localized: Ability Sealed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17402470196711424
    m_Localized: While [Ability Sealed], cannot use Abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351055
  - m_Id: 17715458287996928
    m_Localized: Action Disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17715458359300096
    m_Localized: While [Action Disabled], cannot move or attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351056
  - m_Id: 18825411195179008
    m_Localized: Teleportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18825411291648000
    m_Localized: At the end of its team's turn, moves to a random empty tile on the
      field, then removes [Teleportation].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511530002400673793
